'''Shields of all Sizes''' (ほこ×たて, ''Hoko×Tate'', '''Spear×Shield''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]].

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

